WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.859 --> 00:00:08.370
This is a truly special turning point.
This is a testament to the incredible support

00:00:08.370 --> 00:00:15.440
from so many alumni and friends.
This is an occasion about gratitude and celebration.

00:00:15.440 --> 00:00:19.050
Welcome to this event commemorating the dedication
of the Knight Management Center.

00:00:19.050 --> 00:00:20.050
I feel like I’m walking on air.
Oh, this is amazing.

00:00:20.050 --> 00:00:22.910
It’s a wonderful new beginning for the Business
School.

00:00:22.910 --> 00:00:27.370
The facility is everything we dreamed of.
You know, you plan it on paper and then you

00:00:27.370 --> 00:00:32.290
watch people discover it.
When I was here I thought that Stanford was

00:00:32.290 --> 00:00:34.960
the best place on earth, and this is even
better.

00:00:34.960 --> 00:00:39.120
A great day for Stanford.
All of us who live here and work here and

00:00:39.120 --> 00:00:43.120
teach here are just blown away.
The thought that went to it, the energy that

00:00:43.120 --> 00:00:47.550
comes out of it.
I just think about thirty years ago, it was

00:00:47.550 --> 00:00:52.880
great, the experience, but this is going to
set the stage for the next fifty years.

00:00:52.880 --> 00:00:56.640
I can’t believe I ever left, the sense of
potential you get.

00:00:56.640 --> 00:01:02.219
Definitely proud of being uh, a GSB alum.
I just love the community feel and the openness

00:01:02.219 --> 00:01:06.760
to the University.
Stanford Business School really stands for

00:01:06.760 --> 00:01:11.470
entrepreneurship, innovation and change. That’s
what the Knight Management Center brilliantly

00:01:11.470 --> 00:01:12.930
showcases.
(crowd noise)

00:01:12.930 --> 00:01:19.530
Friendship in the community developed here
during your time at school is just uh, a singular

00:01:19.530 --> 00:01:23.781
experience that we’ll never forget.
Great thing about the GSB is that our alumni

00:01:23.781 --> 00:01:29.090
stay tied to the school. And this is a better
time than ever to renew that collaboration

00:01:29.090 --> 00:01:30.420
and that tie.
(dude!)

00:01:30.420 --> 00:01:35.430
We moved out to Boston. Most weekends we’re
hangin’ out with someone either from my

00:01:35.430 --> 00:01:39.689
class or from my wife’s class.
I found the people that I was with here are

00:01:39.689 --> 00:01:42.439
the kind of people that I want to have in
my life for the rest of my life.

00:01:42.439 --> 00:01:46.630
There’s such an intimate experience for
students at the GSB and that continues lifelong

00:01:46.630 --> 00:01:50.310
for the alumni, too.
Mentor, the first thing that we do is hey

00:01:50.310 --> 00:01:53.060
good feel, what are we going to make happen,
how can we make things better. It’s very

00:01:53.060 --> 00:01:54.060
infectious.
I’ve met several alums that have inspired

00:01:54.060 --> 00:01:55.060
me both professionally and personally.
GSB alum have provided me with opportunities

00:01:55.060 --> 00:02:02.970
that I otherwise wouldn’t have and wouldn’t
have been able to find anywhere else.

00:02:02.970 --> 00:02:06.480
Great role models. They’ve been great friends
and they’ve been great outpoints inspiration.

00:02:06.480 --> 00:02:15.090
What three words define and drive you.
There are nearly 600 flags with amazing messages.

00:02:15.090 --> 00:02:19.530
Flying around the square.
My experience at the GSB really set the stage

00:02:19.530 --> 00:02:23.450
to not be intimidated by anything.
If you work hard and you’re smart, anything

00:02:23.450 --> 00:02:26.840
can happen.
It’s a lifelong experience. It is not one

00:02:26.840 --> 00:02:32.000
you just come and do two years and leave.
It’s about change and changing the world.

00:02:32.000 --> 00:02:35.800
[Chant.: GSB]
To come back uh, is, uh. in a single word,

00:02:35.800 --> 00:02:40.420
uplifting. It’s great to see the bright
young kids and it’s our future. It buoys

00:02:40.420 --> 00:02:46.040
me. The school will define the word management
for future generations. The school will change

00:02:46.040 --> 00:02:48.620
the world.
Just come back and see what it’s like. See

00:02:48.620 --> 00:02:53.129
what our students are doing. Feel the energy.
Give yourself back to that community that

00:02:53.129 --> 00:02:55.260
can learn so much from you.

